</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Each of the two nominees for director was elected to serve until the 2027 annual meeting of stockholders and until their respective successors are elected. </p> <p style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
