</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The stockholders approved an amendment to the Company&#8217;s amended and restated certificate of incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of the Company&#8217;s common stock at a ratio ranging from any whole number between <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">1-for-4</span></span> and <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">1-for-30,</span></span> as determined by the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors in its discretion, subject to the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors&#8217; authority to abandon such amendments. </p> <p style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
